{"RukuNumber":387,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":37,"SurahIndex":"037","VerseNumber":22,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"۞ٱحۡشُرُواْ ٱلَّذِينَ ظَلَمُواْ وَأَزۡوَٰجَهُمۡ وَمَا كَانُواْ يَعۡبُدُونَ","TajweedText":"۞ ٱحْشُرُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِينَ ظَلَمُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> وَأَزْو<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>جَهُمْ وَمَا كَانُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> يَعْبُد<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٢٢</span>","End":"٢٢","PageNumber":446,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":387,"MaqraNumber":179,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":37,"SurahIndex":"037","VerseNumber":23,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ فَٱهۡدُوهُمۡ إِلَىٰ صِرَٰطِ ٱلۡجَحِيمِ","TajweedText":"مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن د</tajweed>ُونِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ فَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>هْدُوهُمْ إِلَىٰ صِر<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>طِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْجَح<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مِ <span class=end>٢٣</span>","End":"٢٣","PageNumber":446,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":387,"MaqraNumber":179,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":37,"SurahIndex":"037","VerseNumber":24,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَقِفُوهُمۡۖ إِنَّهُم مَّسۡـُٔولُونَ","TajweedText":"وَقِفُوهُمْ‌ۖ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َه<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>َّسْــُٔول<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٢٤</span>","End":"٢٤","PageNumber":446,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":387,"MaqraNumber":179,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":37,"SurahIndex":"037","VerseNumber":25,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"مَا لَكُمۡ لَا تَنَاصَرُونَ","TajweedText":"مَا لَكُمْ لَا تَنَاصَر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُ